  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Cut the tops off the rocoto peppers and scoop out the seeds.",
    "In a blender or food processor, combine shio-koji, heavy cream, parmesan cheese, eggs, salt, and black pepper. Blend until smooth.",
    "Stuff each pepper with the shio-koji mixture and place in a baking dish.",
    "Dot the tops of the peppers with butter and cover with foil.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes, then remove the foil and continue baking for 10-15 minutes, or until the peppers are tender and the filling is lightly browned.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh cilantro and serve hot."
